{"2625340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bane Murrain", "steam_appid": 2625340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3005630, 3180300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras/54d9a3cea0c99717c69652d69f6e76fd.avif?t=1780268590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras_big/54d9a3cea0c99717c69652d69f6e76fd.webp?t=1780268590 width=1560 height=1174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE BOOMER SHOOTER TO END THEM ALL (NOT REALLY)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bane Murrain is a cyber-baroque action-horror singleplayer shooter campaign, with emphasis on fast reflexes, resource management and a pinch of speedrunning skill. It's a game built from the foundation of retro shooters like Quake II &amp; Final DOOM, while paying  homage to modern shooter gems like DUSK &amp; Viscerafest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BREAK THE BIOHAZARD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dayne Muren, a nervous engineer worker with a crazy edge, who's thrown out of normality and into a hellish bloodbath after a parasite turns his crewmates into flesh-eating monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through the hordes of undead and punch enemies into exploding gibs in a full campaign of semi-linear, entirely hand-drawn levels, interspliced with voice-acted visual novel story segments where your choices effect all later dialogues. Discover the secrets of the malicious Krotech and the truth behind the K.R.E.V spaceship's unfolding chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Y2K ALL THE WAY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early 2000s sci-fi and survival horror aesthetics merge with a regal stitching to form the K.R.E.V, a research space station turned into a warped nightmare. We've even got a saferoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a one-dev job and a huge personal passion project, so if you're reading this... thanks for being here!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1780268590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras_big/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1780268590 width=800 height=80 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras/54d9a3cea0c99717c69652d69f6e76fd.avif?t=1780268590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras_big/54d9a3cea0c99717c69652d69f6e76fd.webp?t=1780268590 width=1560 height=1174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE BOOMER SHOOTER TO END THEM ALL (NOT REALLY)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bane Murrain is a cyber-baroque action-horror singleplayer shooter campaign, with emphasis on fast reflexes, resource management and a pinch of speedrunning skill. It's a game built from the foundation of retro shooters like Quake II &amp; Final DOOM, while paying  homage to modern shooter gems like DUSK &amp; Viscerafest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BREAK THE BIOHAZARD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dayne Muren, a nervous engineer worker with a crazy edge, who's thrown out of normality and into a hellish bloodbath after a parasite turns his crewmates into flesh-eating monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through the hordes of undead and punch enemies into exploding gibs in a full campaign of semi-linear, entirely hand-drawn levels, interspliced with voice-acted visual novel story segments where your choices effect all later dialogues. Discover the secrets of the malicious Krotech and the truth behind the K.R.E.V spaceship's unfolding chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Y2K ALL THE WAY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early 2000s sci-fi and survival horror aesthetics merge with a regal stitching to form the K.R.E.V, a research space station turned into a warped nightmare. We've even got a saferoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a one-dev job and a huge personal passion project, so if you're reading this... thanks for being here!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1780268590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/extras_big/e3d70fe16c07d6cdd6822e6114c517c8.avif?t=1780268590 width=800 height=80 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A cyber-baroque horror-comedy boomer-shooter where you punch undead abominations so hard they explode, with a fully voiced campaign effected by your dialogue choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/3d7553fa387f90033a7208f692550c76277465b7/header.jpg?t=1780268590", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625340/2626142949673d0ecf65f4b449a7022388cde472/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178